{"title":"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">2000 AMC 12 #3</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems\">2000 AMC 10 #3</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Algebra)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Algebra)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each day, Jenny ate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the jellybeans that were in her jar at the beginning of that day. At the end of the second day, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> remained. How many jellybeans were in the jar originally?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/8/c88b19343a3c421772065a88497cfc64ee8bd936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\ 40 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)} \\ 50  \\qquad \\textbf{(C)} \\ 55 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)} \\ 60 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)} \\ 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Algebra.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Algebra)\">Solution 1 (Algebra)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Algebra)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of jellybeans originally in the jar. Then after one day, there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/a/17a2fb4bcc6090bd04da6e4dbe232e0374589212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8x$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> jellybeans left, while after two days, there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/b/d9b896af155af70e645de9a1ff9cb34407d04580.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8(0.8x)=0.64x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"20\" /> jellybeans left.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/4/ba4cdb65c6ac68cfe08cb396a1be8edda9564c7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.64x = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"14\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6c2aebee22722498dd916eebba9e7345e689d16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"100\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-armang32324, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At the end of the day, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/a/68aae808b22fcf799765bfef8aeb72869b0c0a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\% = \\frac{4}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"72\" height=\"38\" /> of the jellybeans from the start of the day remained.  So after one day, there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/1/0e1f0aed4cf7ee50075513d46d43bca462bcf5b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32 \\div \\frac{4}{5} = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" /> jellybeans left, while at the start, there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/7/9c7fec61d97f92a5b5a83469bc95c13b6525b558.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40 \\div \\frac{4}{5} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"143\" height=\"38\" /> jellybeans left.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Starting with each answer choice (A) through (E) results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/0/e30ce787e03597c0c83b99aa7a8edc2d0f3c041b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25.6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/8/5b8b347d9886c0eb9c17b0c3682613f22ecea1f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/2/2727fb57e38b1971c1c82119fa694f7f42b7febb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$38.4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5afbad0b221f0ef70186fe70b08e6fc1efdd8dfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> jellybeans left after two days, respectively.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/3/cb34774024a33951b318a48059e39e0827ed605b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} \\ 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" /> is correct.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YrAs8vadKMk?si=Iyr_dgDtteNdYPj1&amp;t=138\">https://youtu.be/YrAs8vadKMk?si=Iyr_dgDtteNdYPj1&amp;t=138</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qJYI_qOMyTo?si=jFa9C5BObcWaI_r6\">https://youtu.be/qJYI_qOMyTo?si=jFa9C5BObcWaI_r6</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12\" title=\"2000 AMC 12\">2000 AMC 12</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width